<div class="weekly-widget no-print">
<div class="weekly-widget-left">
<div class="weekly-widget-icon">📝</div>
<div class="weekly-widget-info">
<h3>이번 주 학습 기록</h3>
<p>이번 주에 작성한 학습 노트 개수입니다.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="weekly-widget-right">
<span class="weekly-count" id="weeklyPortfolioCount">0</span>
<div class="weekly-widget-actions">
<button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="openAddModal()">✏️ 새 기록</button>
<button class="btn btn-sm" onclick="applyTemplate('today')">📋 오늘 배운 내용</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="filter-row no-print">
<select class="form-select" id="courseFilter" onchange="filterByCourse()">
<option value="all">전체 강좌</option>
</select>
<select class="form-select" id="statusFilter" onchange="filterByCourse()">
<option value="all">전체 상태</option>
<option value="draft">📄 임시</option>
<option value="published">📝 발행</option>
<option value="approved">✅ 승인</option>
</select>
<span class="filter-count" id="portfolioCountLabel">총 0개</span>
</div>

<div id="journalContainer">
<div class="empty-state">
<div class="empty-icon">📖</div>
<h3>아직 기록이 없습니다</h3>
<p>오늘 배운 내용을 기록해 보세요!</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="modal-overlay" id="detailModal">
<div class="modal modal-lg">
<div id="detailContent"></div>
<div class="modal-actions no-print">
<button class="btn btn-text" onclick="closeModal('detailModal')">닫기</button>
<button class="btn btn-filled" id="detailEditBtn">✏️ 수정</button>
<button class="btn btn-danger" id="detailDeleteBtn">🗑️ 삭제</button>
<button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="printDetail()">🖨️ 인쇄</button>
</div>
</div>
